WEBVTT

00:07:28.736 --> 00:07:30.404
So they demanded a login.

00:07:30.404 --> 00:07:32.114
And then another bright light said,

00:07:32.114 --> 00:07:34.033
"Oh, we can charge."

00:07:34.074 --> 00:07:35.409
So they put up a paywall.

00:07:35.451 --> 00:07:37.244
And then a third bright light said,

00:07:37.286 --> 00:07:39.705
"We can't let anybody
have this information at all.

00:07:39.747 --> 00:07:41.123
They might compete with us."

00:07:41.123 --> 00:07:42.750
And that's where we are today.

00:07:43.459 --> 00:07:46.295
We can't get what we need
to fix our stuff.

00:07:47.129 --> 00:07:49.673
Now, I can tell you
because I've had a front-row seat,

00:07:49.715 --> 00:07:54.637
this trend towards a throwaway economy
is reversing all over the world.

00:07:55.179 --> 00:07:57.890
And it's really fun to be able
to tell you about it.

00:07:58.224 --> 00:08:00.059
Back in 2014,